        {
            "heading": "Tour of Cosmo-Georgian Interiors",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Step inside the newly transformed spaces of a historic London landmark and experience a joyful explosion of colour, history, and community. On this guided  tour, we explore the \"Cosmo-Georgian\" common areas inside the South and West Wings of Somerset House. Once a symbol of the 18th-century British Empire, these spaces have been reimagined to celebrate the diverse cultures that have long shaped and enriched London."
